/* World Board Game Atlas — the changelog (shared/atlas-updates.js, split out of shared/atlas.js 2026-11-15)
   Only the pages that show it load it: the top page (badges) and the portal (news, badges). The game pages load
   shared/atlas.js alone, so a new line here no longer makes every page download the whole changelog again.
   Add a line whenever a game gets a visible update: [date, gameId, ja, en, { zh, ko, es, fr, pt, de, hi, ar, ru, 'zh-TW', id, tr }].
   An id of the form tab:<page> is a portal feature rather than a game: its card opens that tab of the portal (atlas/app.js).
   The 5th element is optional; missing languages fall back to en. Newest first.
   Lines older than 14 days before the newest move to shared/atlas-updates-archive.js: node tools/news-archive.js (2026-11-17).
   RULE: one line per game per day, no game name (the card shows it); a friendly line that makes people want to play
   (2026-11-17), ja ≤ 80 chars, other languages ≤ 160. Check with node tools/news-check.js.
   After editing: bump atlas-updates.js?v= in index.html and atlas/index.html (shared/atlas.js need not change). */
